{"data":{"body":"[P2] Set the termination flag before invoking shutdown callbacks\n\n`terminate()` invokes `setCheckpointTerminating` before setting `isTerminated`. The installed callback disables checkpoints and synchronously calls `terminated.abort()`. An abort listener that starts a step therefore reads `false` here and passes the new guard, allowing its function to run after checkpoints are disabled. Move the flag assignment before the callback and add a regression that starts an operation synchronously from an abort listener.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABDWM4lw","finding_digest":"1775fd6225120ff20a05a79915c7aea5034b331dbe127669ea7862d61d7b4219","finding_id":"arf_v1_c5272yrfcih7ecqfu6mrlr5ouu","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/termination-manager/termination-manager.ts::terminate::operation-admission-before-termination-latch","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/termination-manager/termination-manager.ts::terminate::operation-admission-before-termination-latch","line":67,"observation_digest":"4a1bfae606648bbed3eaf23a580f03d02ad2a9686646032950e42c9e643d56db","observation_id":"aro_v1_jin7vzqgmsf35u7k6i5fqdyd2a","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/termination-manager/termination-manager.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_c5272yrfcih7ecqfu6mrlr5ouu","published_at":"2026-11-10T00:17:43Z","review_id":"arr_v1_sajceyzihphknqj3byfmsv6p4u","reviewed_base_sha":"d80f532428c15b451052841e5e6848d8f821d351","reviewed_head_sha":"40d39f3be6836e766bf14711357eaf8653ac7826","reviewer":"codex","start_line":66,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1202},"record_id":"art_v1_uggjfewghnfotaulrz4gds2wir","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-10T00:17:43Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
